;;;; This is a list of all the implemented SRFIs. The format of each item of
;;;; this list is:
;;;;    1. SRFI number (an int)
;;;;    2. Title of the SRFI (a string)
;;;;    3. The feature name of the this SRFI (a list, empty if no feature name is
;;;;       defined and an fourth element is needed)
;;;;    4. #t if the SRFI is embedded (if absent we asumme it is #f)
;;;; Points 3 and 4 are optional.
;;;;


